# BookRec — environment variables
#
# The app ALWAYS works without any keys: the conversational RAG/DAG re-ranker
# falls back to a transparent, deterministic heuristic at every stage. Set the
# key below to upgrade the chat to the live Gemini-powered pipeline.
#
# Get a free key: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# On Vercel: Project Settings -> Environment Variables -> add GEMINI_API_KEY.

# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-google-ai-studio-key

# Optional: override the Gemini model (defaults to gemini-2.0-flash, matching the
# original Streamlit framework).
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
